    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords &amp; Bones 5 is the ultimate conclusion to the saga. It\u2019s also the most challenging chapter, designed to test the skills of veterans who have played every installment! <br>Take on the role of Basil, an apprentice archer transformed into a rat-man by a demon. You\u2019ll be able to purchase enchanted arrows and wield a dagger to defeat enemies. <br>Collect power-ups and tackle new challenges in mouse form, with gameplay designed around hardcore platforming mechanics. <br>Gather all the Heroes\u2019 Trophies and restore peace to the kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new ability that lets you transform into a tiny mouse!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final chapter of the saga, with unparalleled difficulty!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A revamped magic system using enchanted arrows!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved graphics and sound!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up your hero collecting coins!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 action-packed levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 fearsome bosses ready to fight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endings to discover!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel-art graphics in 16-bit style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An epic and dark chiptune soundtrack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords &amp; Bones 5 is the ultimate conclusion to the saga. It\u2019s also the most challenging chapter, designed to test the skills of veterans who have played every installment! <br>Take on the role of Basil, an apprentice archer transformed into a rat-man by a demon. You\u2019ll be able to purchase enchanted arrows and wield a dagger to defeat enemies. <br>Collect power-ups and tackle new challenges in mouse form, with gameplay designed around hardcore platforming mechanics. <br>Gather all the Heroes\u2019 Trophies and restore peace to the kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new ability that lets you transform into a tiny mouse!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final chapter of the saga, with unparalleled difficulty!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A revamped magic system using enchanted arrows!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved graphics and sound!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up your hero collecting coins!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 action-packed levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 fearsome bosses ready to fight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endings to discover!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel-art graphics in 16-bit style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An epic and dark chiptune soundtrack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The fifth and final chapter of the saga: embark on an action-platformer fantasy adventure in pixel art and put an end to the demonic threat once and for all!",
